@startuml
' Chatbot Workflow - Sequence Diagram
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title RAG Chatbot Workflow (Sequence Diagram)

actor User
participant Frontend as "Frontend\n(React)"
participant API as "Backend API\n(FastAPI)"
participant ChatService as "ChatService\n(RAG Orchestrator)"
participant SearchService as "SearchService\n(Meilisearch Hybrid)"
participant Embed as "EmbeddingService\n(Sentence-Transformers)"
participant Meili as "Meilisearch\n(Index)"
participant Gemini as "Gemini API\n(LLM)"
participant Cache as "Cache / Embedding Cache"
participant Ingest as "IngestionService\n(PDF -> Docs)"

== User interaction ==
User -> Frontend: type message / question
Frontend -> API: POST /api/v1/chat {message, history}
API -> ChatService: handle_message(message, history)

== Query expansion & preprocessing ==
ChatService -> ChatService: expand & normalize query
ChatService -> Cache: check cached_context(query)
alt cache hit
    Cache --> ChatService: cached_context
else cache miss
    ChatService -> SearchService: search(query, limit=K, semantic_ratio)
    note right of SearchService: SearchService will
    note right of SearchService: - generate query embedding (Embed)
    SearchService -> Embed: encode(query)
    Embed --> SearchService: query_vector
    SearchService -> Meili: hybrid_search(query, vector, params)
    Meili --> SearchService: hits (top-K docs)
    SearchService --> ChatService: formatted_hits
    ChatService -> Cache: store_context(query, formatted_hits)
    Cache --> ChatService: ack
end

== Build context for LLM ==
ChatService -> ChatService: select + format context (top docs + metadata)
ChatService -> Gemini: generate_response(system_prompt + context + user_message)
alt Gemini success
    Gemini --> ChatService: assistant_text
else Gemini failure
    ChatService -> ChatService: fallback_message_generation()
    ChatService --> API: assistant_text (fallback)
    return
end

== Return to user ==
ChatService --> API: assistant_text
API --> Frontend: assistant_text
Frontend --> User: display assistant response

== Background / Admin flows ==
User -> Frontend: request re-ingest (admin)
Frontend -> API: POST /api/v1/ingest?force_reindex=true
API -> Ingest: run_ingestion(force=True)
Ingest -> Embed: generate_embeddings_for_documents
Ingest -> Meili: add_documents_with_vectors
Meili --> Ingest: indexing_tasks
Ingest --> API: ingestion_status
API --> Frontend: ingestion_result

== Notes and error handling ==
note over ChatService,SearchService
- All search calls handle Meilisearch errors (invalid_embedder, timeouts)
- ChatService falls back to keyword-only search if hybrid fails
- Gemini calls have retry and safety filters; on filter trigger return safe fallback
end note

@enduml
